{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1244722-venom-and-other-marvel-symbiotes-as-geist-inspiration","id":1244722,"title":"Venom ( and other Marvel Symbiotes ) as Geist inspiration?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-10T22:10:21-07:00","id":1244722,"title":"Venom ( and other Marvel Symbiotes ) as Geist inspiration?","content":"So when thinking about <b>Geist</b> 2E I watched latest Venom trailer - and it hit me. Is not Marvel Symbiotes - Venom, Carnage and rest - known widely as <a href=\"http://marvel.wikia.com/wiki/Klyntar_(Race)\" target=\"_blank\">Klyntar race</a> - relations with their hosts works as great parallel to Geist-Bound dynamic? Geists are, in the end, alien forces of Death that are only passingly with human traits. Most of the time they are alien beings, having great power, that host need to Synergy to success, yes?<br /> <br /> See the trailer for more Symbiote-Host dynamics that could be Giest-Bound one, with Eddie being Bound and Venom being Geist. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uSBDZkeGjJE\" data-code=\"uSBDZkeGjJE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/uSBDZkeGjJE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T22:36:04-07:00","id":1244725,"title":"","content":"I would say they would fit a deviants if they have symbiotes (and by the way that trailer gave me faith in the movie, the comics should make venom (the creature) back to being more his own person again.<br /> <br /> Anyway, i fail to see how they are like geist, sure they fuse with you and can cure cancer, but they aren't really involved with death itself, only the act of killing<br /> <br /> EDIT: My geist knowledge is limited, so don't be surprised if see how ignorant my post is or how easily you can prove me wrong","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-10T23:25:51-07:00","id":1244733,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1244722-venom-and-other-marvel-symbiotes-as-geist-inspiration#post1244722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Geists are, <b>in the end</b>, alien forces of Death that are only passingly with human traits. Most of the time they are alien beings, having great power, that host need to Synergy to success, yes?</div> </div> </div> </div>More like in the beginning. In the end geists are non-human people the Bound either works with or enslaves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-07T12:58:55-07:00","id":1259448,"title":"","content":"While I wouldn\u2019t compare them too closely, having just seen the movie I would very much take inspiration from how Eddie and the Symbiote converse with each other as a way to portray how a new Bound and Geist May act towards each other","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-08T01:31:53-07:00","id":1259549,"title":"","content":"Having said that, watching Venom a second time and giving Todd McFarlane\u2019s other works another glance, something occurred to me that honestly surprised me that no one else brought up, concerning this topic.<br /> <br /> While I still agree that Symbiotes aren\u2019t an accurate comparison for Geister, there is another , greatly overlooked and under-appreciated and to my knowledge unfinished series that is a perfect source of inspiration for Geist; Haunt.<br /> <br /> For those of you who are like \u201c Koro, what the fuck are you talking about?\u201d, well I\u2019m glad you asked! A few years ago Todd McFarlane worked to create a comic series that was sort of interesting blend of Venom and Spawn called Haunt; which followed the ordeals of a faithless, mildly psychic Priest who due to a near death experience sees himself tethered to the ghost of his dead brother.<br /> <br /> Like many other protagonists drawn/ written by McFarlane, the two brothers have a symbiotic link to each other, and when they are in full accord they can merge together to form the ghostly entity called haunt, who possesses a very Symbiote/ Necroplasm suit combat form made of ectoplasm.<br /> <br /> Long story short, Haunt is basically a ghost Symbiote that follows many similar tropes to Venom, and his powers are very similar to the Haunts of second ed, especially the Caul, Shroud, and Rage. I very strongly recommend giving Haunt a read if anyone wants to base a Geist off of Venom <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{