,{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-14T10:12:45-07:00","id":1260534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1244722-venom-and-other-marvel-symbiotes-as-geist-inspiration?p=1260362#post1260362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> He likes the interplay?</div> </div> </div> </div>To the point of obsessiveness","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-19T09:15:32-07:00","id":1261584,"title":"","content":"It gives a lone protagonist someone to argue with.<br /> <br /> The Venom of the comic might be a little more geist-like in that he has unresolved issues with things in the world (ongoing attempt at a one-sided codependence with Spider-Man). A geist who started out as a doppelganger to someone who's since moved on from where they were when they had their near death experience, and <i>can't stand that</i> - eventually drinks from a river, becomes a geist, and Bargain with someone all in a convoluted attempt to reach their living counterpart and get them back &quot;on track&quot; - there's some similarity to Venom there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachment